    "initial_model_scope": "Bounded nominal coupling profiles for all127 GH and3 mains, 129 independent functions. Whole P own-load current class, real contacts, manufacturing envelopes and joined utility/common/current/voltage acceptance remain separate required proof. No ideal P or rest-network node.",
