    "main_array_rows": 5,
    "main_array_scope": "Enumerate only legal original-grid sites in all six fixed 4x4 lands using the synchronized bare native pad/drill/keepout authority. Do not insert a knowingly colliding 150-via trial or assume 25 sites survive. Retain exact accepted and rejected identities; no displaced ideal coupling.",
