    "minimum_track_width_mm": 0.2,
    "model_entry": "Actual passing pinned KiCad 10.0.6 rule/parity receipt, exact source/native/companion hashes, all214 source own-load AGND plus127 GH and3 main contacts connected, explicit physical face and complete inventory. A bare planning export or failed candidate cannot enter a conductor model.",
