    "own_terminal_scope": "The two original and four explicitly replanned individual POWER reservations each protect one fixed B-side land. Preserve their polygons and track/zone prohibitions; use the same narrowly tested owning reference/net/whole-object predicates as K, with P-specific UUID, B-face, origin and shape verification. No foreign hardware or header receives an owning-terminal exception. A B-face positive/negative native fixture is required before a full candidate.",
    "physical_preservation": "All 418 source footprints and 139 lock-bound controls retain exact origin, angle, face, pin/net identity and owner/library geometry. The only proposed geometric changes are the explicit local RV601 edge tab and replacement of the broad load-power strip with four individual B-side reservations. All mounting holes, foreign-net pad/drill exclusions and unrelated reservations remain unchanged. Source netlist native fields are projected separately from property markers, with every original schematic unit retained.",
